stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> RawPunch: punch ingested from any channel, FR-ATT-010

    RawPunch --> SkewCorrected: apply per-device clock offset FR-DEV-003, raw retained
    SkewCorrected --> Deduped: drop re-deliveries on device_sn, user, ts, dir plus payload_hash, FR-DEV-001 AC4
    Deduped --> DirectionResolved: order by time, AUTO alternates IN/OUT/IN/OUT

    DirectionResolved --> Pairing: match IN to next OUT within shift-day

    state Pairing {
        [*] --> MatchINtoOUT
        MatchINtoOUT --> BreakSplit: extra IN/OUT pairs from break punching
        BreakSplit --> MatchINtoOUT: sum sessions
        MatchINtoOUT --> [*]
    }

    Pairing --> ExceptionMissingOut: IN with no OUT, case 2
    Pairing --> ExceptionMissingIn: OUT with no IN, case 3
    Pairing --> SessionPaired: one or more valid IN/OUT pairs

    ExceptionMissingOut --> Regularization: never auto-full-day, never silent zero, FR-ATT-020 AC2
    ExceptionMissingIn --> Regularization
    Regularization --> DirectionResolved: approved edit recomputes day, FR-ATT-001 and FR-REG-001

    SessionPaired --> WorkedHours: deduct unpaid break, grace absorbs late-in, FR-SHF-001
    note right of WorkedHours
        Overnight 22:00 to 06:15: worked hours
        anchored to shift-START pay date, not
        split at midnight, AC1
        Pre-shift early-in excluded unless OT
        pre-approved, late-out is OT candidate
        Day IN and OUT kept for Form IX
    end note

    WorkedHours --> SpreadOverCheck: rest-interval and spread-over limits raise warnings only
    SpreadOverCheck --> DayStatus: derive status plus LOP and paid-days, FR-ATT-021

    DayStatus --> [*]: Present / Half-day / Absent / On-leave / Weekly-off / Holiday / OD / LOP
    note right of DayStatus
        Deterministic: identical input yields
        identical output, AC4. Recomputable
        against rule version in force for the date
        while the punches are held.
    end note
